fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"gstreamer/gstvalue.html#gst_value_is_subset","fragment":"\n\tgst_value_is_subset\n\n\n\tGst.prototype.value_is_subset\n\n\n\tGst.value_is_subset\n\nCheck that value1 is a subset of value2. If value1 and value2 is are\nfixed value, value1 must be a subset of value2 and not equal to value2 to\nbe a subset of value2.\nReturn: TRUE is value1 is a subset, strict subset if both values are  of value2\nParameters:\na GValue\na GValue\nCheck that value1 is a subset of value2. If value1 and value2 is are\nfixed value, value1 must be a subset of value2 and not equal to value2 to\nbe a subset of value2.\nReturn: true is value1 is a subset, strict subset if both values are  of value2\nParameters:\na GObject.Value\na GObject.Value\nCheck that value1 is a subset of value2. If value1 and value2 is are\nfixed value, value1 must be a subset of value2 and not equal to value2 to\nbe a subset of value2.\nReturn: True is value1 is a subset, strict subset if both values are  of value2\nParameters:\na GObject.Value\na GObject.Value\n"});